                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kibelokin Petero, koany ekesisian lokemina Yesu etupit, ŋes ŋol lokegoŋakina katorob naka Yesu kapak kaya naka inyamat lukatiboŋ, loabala ebe, “Ejakait, iŋai bo kibilakini ebotet?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso keanyu Petero ŋol, kotema ŋesi Yesu atiar, “Ejakait, ido bo lo ikwaikinio ai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Yesu ŋes atiar, “Arai akoto ŋol aidarit aitodol neabunio, ipodo bo ijo inyo? Kotupunai ijo eoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisiarakin akirot ŋin oinacan, ebe mam ekesisian ŋol etwani, konye mam kebala Yesu ebe mam etwani; konye ebe, “Arai akoto ŋol aidarit aitodol neabunio, ipodo bo ijo inyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
