              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejaas da akiro ace nuipu nueswamat Yesu, arai kiwadikatai ŋinidiopet, aomit ti mam akwapin ilosikinos iitabon lutikiwadikai.",
